# Tourmaline Project Recipe v1
#
# The Bistro demo project's DEMO-RELEASE pak set (the demo-content
# GitHub release asset set: bistro_static.tapp + bistro_static-<hash>.pak).
# The Bistro exterior (Amazon Lumberyard Bistro, Open Research Content
# Archive — CC BY 4.0) cooks STATIC (setStatic root) with LODs ON so the
# scene is GPU-scene-raster eligible; the scene authors no GI volumes and
# no cubemap captures, so the recipe-level bakes stay OFF (the GiBaker
# and Cook stages exit clean with nothing to bake).
#
# See BISTRO-CREDITS.md before distributing the cooked pak.

recipe 1
project Bistro
entry content/scenes/bistro_static.tour

import lods on

bake gi off
bake cubemaps off

[pak bistro_static]
output bistro_static.pak
scene content/scenes/bistro_static.tour
